seg-753192a770ac = "Not observed" is the absence of a feature: draw it neutrally (no fill, or a hatch), never in the colour of "clear". Use a colour scheme that does not rely on red against green alone. Cell details on hover or selection show the counts in <c1/> as given, and every <c2/> count as "withheld (fewer than { "5" })", never as zero. A viewer should also say when <c3/> is false that the file uses a cell size outside the pre-registered method.

