seg-f36389caf81b = These values were set from the definitions of the NIC and NACp codes and from the privacy rule before any data was looked at. They were not tuned on real data, and the tests use synthetic data only. Cell statuses: <c1/>, <c2/>, <c3/> (published but fewer than { "10" } sampled aircraft), <c4/> and <c5/>.

