seg-b2ea2ec6bad1 = <b>Version { "2" }.</b> Version { "1" } qualified a detector from { "3" } flagged vessels and published counts of { "3" } and { "4" }. Version { "2" } raises the flagged-vessel minimum to { "5" }, the publication minimum, so an <c1/> call never rests on fewer vessels than the number below which counts are withheld. This tightens the method and no version { "1" } file was released.

